# Phase 11a — Assistant shell (OpenAI)

**Branch:** `phase-11a-assistant-shell`

## Goal

Embedded assistant chat with OpenAI streaming; settings status; no write tools yet.

## Exit criteria

- `OPENAI_API_KEY` in env; assistant disabled cleanly if missing
- `GET /api/v1/assistant/status`, `POST /api/v1/assistant/chat` (SSE)
- Assistant slide-over panel + `/settings/assistant` + ⌘K entry
- Optional page context string attached to the request (no tool loop yet)
- INSTALL notes for outbound HTTPS + key

## Non-goals

Record write tools, fetch_url, Anthropic, thread persistence (11b/11c).
